{"about_the_game":"<strong>Lock\u2019n Load into a world of pixels!</strong><br><br>2 Many Pixels is an endless &amp; fast-paced 2D minimal shooter. Blast enemies &amp; unlock upgrades to help you survive for as long as possible!<br><br>I bet you think you're a pro gamer, maybe even a god gamer and have been playing games all your life with thousands of hours played... Well, it's time to put those hours to use and show off your wicked-sick gaming skills to all your friends!<br><br>Prove you're not a complete noob and that years of being addicted to playing video games has been worth it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Blast endless waves of enemies.<br></li><li> Survive for as long as you can.<br></li><li> Earn tokens from killing enemies.<br></li><li> Equip permanent upgrades.<br></li><li> Achievements!<br></li><li> Trash Talker - to remind you how noob you are.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230040/extras/Steam_banner_upgrades.png?t=1698078305\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230040/extras/Steam_banners_perks.png?t=1698078305\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230040/extras/Steam_banner_ach.png?t=1698078305\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230040/extras/Achievements_smaller.png?t=1698078305\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1 KAy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2230040/f7ba7f3696e129268ac7bb5f794a2ca8c2e31c62.jpg"},{"name":"Stacks On Stacks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2230040/ee169c67d9d2608d87896ee6dbf742b3ff51a04c.jpg"},{"name":"Swagging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2230040/65e4301464988